{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A mashup of two classics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sokogram merges Nonogram logic grids with Sokoban box-pushing puzzles. Instead of coloring in a picture, the Nonogram clues guide you in drawing a path across the grid. Solve puzzles by finding a path that satisfies the clues while allowing every box to reach its goal. Each handcrafted puzzle has a unique solution that can only be found by combining both rulesets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/4ccdb0e1c217387e0557d8090377ae43.poster.avif?t=1774881802\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/4ccdb0e1c217387e0557d8090377ae43.webm?t=1774881802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/4ccdb0e1c217387e0557d8090377ae43.mp4?t=1774881802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There might be many paths that fulfill the Nonogram requirements but only one represents a solvable Sokoban puzzle. Once the drawing is complete, every box must be pushed into place to confirm your solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/20ada2295142203d521c4397316e2667.poster.avif?t=1774881802\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/20ada2295142203d521c4397316e2667.webm?t=1774881802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/20ada2295142203d521c4397316e2667.mp4?t=1774881802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More than just boxes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Later puzzles introduce new mechanics such as rolling snowballs, placeable obstacles like rocks and tree stumps, and quirky creatures like leaping frogs or scaredy bats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/ee1e8996fb8959a3454f38076c20fa0f.poster.avif?t=1774881802\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/ee1e8996fb8959a3454f38076c20fa0f.webm?t=1774881802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/ee1e8996fb8959a3454f38076c20fa0f.mp4?t=1774881802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonogram meets Sokoban</strong>\u00a0- Draw on a Nonogram grid while planning Sokoban moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intertwined logic</strong>\u00a0- You\u2019re not solving two separate puzzles but one unified challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted puzzles</strong>\u00a0- More than 150 puzzles with unique solutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear progression</strong> - Choose puzzles in an overworld that expands as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hint system</strong> - In case you get stuck...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054100?t=1774881802","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/8bc108df3eb3d6dc81f99bf8adbcca996eac670c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774881802","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/4d753652504ab3b4672950882b38a08c17196173/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774881802","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/4d753652504ab3b4672950882b38a08c17196173/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774881802","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4309210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A mashup of two classics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sokogram merges Nonogram logic grids with Sokoban box-pushing puzzles. Instead of coloring in a picture, the Nonogram clues guide you in drawing a path across the grid. Solve puzzles by finding a path that satisfies the clues while allowing every box to reach its goal. Each handcrafted puzzle has a unique solution that can only be found by combining both rulesets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/4ccdb0e1c217387e0557d8090377ae43.poster.avif?t=1774881802\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/4ccdb0e1c217387e0557d8090377ae43.webm?t=1774881802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/4ccdb0e1c217387e0557d8090377ae43.mp4?t=1774881802\" type=\"video